# =============================================================================
# API Information:
# =============================================================================

# Face++ (ACTIVE):
# - 1,000 free requests/month
# - Comprehensive face analysis (age, gender, emotion, beauty score)
# - 106-point facial landmarks
# - No credit card required
# - Sign up: https://www.faceplusplus.com/

# Google Vision (OPTIONAL):
# - 1,000 free requests/month (requires billing enabled)
# - Web entity detection, similar images
# - Excellent accuracy
# - Requires credit card for verification

# Azure Face (OPTIONAL):
# - 30,000 free requests/month (first year)
# - Age, gender, emotion detection
# - Face verification and identification

# AWS Rekognition (OPTIONAL):
# - 5,000 free images/month (first 12 months)
# - Celebrity recognition (huge database)
# - Face comparison and search

# =============================================================================
# Usage in App:
# 1. Start: streamlit run app.py
# 2. Go to Face Search
# 3. Enable "External Database Search"
# 4. Select "Face++ API" (or other configured APIs)
# 5. Upload photo and get real AI results!
# =============================================================================